---
source: crates/tk/tests/scenarios.rs
expression: "p.run(&format!(\"{command} --help\"))"
---
Promote a Local Ticket or Epic through the configured Remote

Usage: tk promote [OPTIONS] <ID>
       tk promote <COMMAND>

Commands:
  reconcile  Attach a confirmed Backend object to an indeterminate Promotion
  retry      Explicitly risk creating the Backend object again
  cancel     Withdraw the whole Promotion Operation without reaching the Backend

Arguments:
  <ID>  Display ID or Alias of the Ticket or Epic to promote

Options:
      --children  Also promote the Local Tickets the Epic or Ticket directly holds — its Promotion Children
  -h, --help      Print help
